  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>&nbsp;Henderson&#39;s equation for calculating&nbsp;p<sup>H</sup> of acidic buffer solutions is given as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>pH</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>pK</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>Salt</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>Acid</mi></mfenced></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>pH</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>pK</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msup><mi>COO</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>COOH</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msup><mi>COO</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>COOH</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msup><mi>COO</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>COOH</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msup><mi>COO</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=